  "title": "Sock it to Me Cake V",
  "description": "This version of the popular Sock it to Me Cake is made from scratch. It consists of a rich yellow cake baked in a tube pan with a streak of cinnamon, brown sugar and pecans in the center.",
  "authors": [
    "Arvilla"
